  observe() {}
  unobserve() {}
  disconnect() {}
};",
    "globalThis<span class=p>.</span>ResizeObserver <span class=p>??= </span><span class=k>class </span><span class=p>{</span>
  <span class=t>observe</span><span class=p>() {}</span>
